      "person_id": "imu_6k9_4ay",
      "related_person_ids": [],
      "reading": "裴注「音普」釋王誧名音。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-sanguozhi-050-wu:line016:reading-000-043",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-050-wu:line016",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 43,
      "source_quote": "及權少年統業，夫人助治軍國，甚有補益。建安七年，臨薨，引見張昭等，屬以後事，合葬高陵。",
      "person_id": "lm8_q5h_5uy",
      "related_person_ids": [
        "572_278_cba",
        "roi_rz4_ute"
      ],
      "reading": "主文以建安七年繫吳夫人臨薨、屬後事、合葬高陵。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-sanguozhi-050-wu:line016-pei01-01:reading-000-129",
      "kind": "annotation_sentence",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-050-wu:line016-pei01-01",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 129,
      "source_quote": "《會稽典錄》曰：策功曹魏騰，以迕意見譴，將殺之，士大夫憂恐，計無所出。夫人乃倚大井而謂策曰：「汝新造江南，其事未集，方當優賢禮士，舍過錄功。魏功曹在公盡規，汝今日殺之，則明日人皆叛汝。吾不忍見禍之及，當先投此井中耳。」策大驚，遽釋騰。夫人智略權譎，類皆如此。",
      "person_id": "lm8_q5h_5uy",
      "related_person_ids": [
        "e9c_070_567",
        "v27_nrq_ppt"
      ],
      "reading": "會稽典錄記夫人臨井勸策，得釋魏騰。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-sanguozhi-050-wu:line016-pei02-01:reading-000-059",
      "kind": "annotation_sentence",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-050-wu:line016-pei02-01",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 59,
      "source_quote": "《志林》曰：按會稽貢舉簿，建安十二年到十三年闕，無舉者，云府君遭憂，此則吳后以十二年薨也。八年九年皆有貢舉，斯甚分明。",
      "person_id": "lm8_q5h_5uy",
      "related_person_ids": [],
      "reading": "志林據貢舉簿聞府君遭憂而推建安十二年薨，另於正文七年。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-sanguozhi-050-wu:line018:reading-000-065",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-050-wu:line018",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 65,
      "source_quote": "八年，景卒宮，子奮授兵為將，封新亭侯，卒。子安嗣，安坐黨魯王霸死。奮弟祺嗣，封都亭侯，卒。子纂嗣。纂妻即滕胤女也，胤被誅，竝遇害。",
      "person_id": "ere_ume_47r",
      "related_person_ids": [
        "ere_ume_47r_A",
        "ere_ume_47r_AA",
        "572_278_cba_B",
        "ks4_7z0_n17",
        "ks4_7z0_n17_A",
        "wgt_wdg_vkv_A",
        "wgt_wdg_vkv"
      ],
      "reading": "景卒，奮授兵；安嗣後死，奮弟祺嗣，祺子纂妻為滕胤女，竝遇害。數位「卒宮」印「卒官」。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-sanguozhi-050-wu:line018-pei01-01:reading-000-023",
      "kind": "annotation_sentence",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-050-wu:line018-pei01-01",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 23,
      "source_quote": "《吳書》曰：權徵荊州，拜奮吳郡都督，以鎮東方。",
      "person_id": "ere_ume_47r_A",
      "related_person_ids": [
        "572_278_cba"
      ],
      "reading": "吳書稱奮為吳郡都督。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-sanguozhi-050-wu:line018-pei01-02:reading-000-024",
      "kind": "annotation_sentence",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-050-wu:line018-pei01-02",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 24,
      "source_quote": "《吳書》曰：祺與張溫、顧譚友善，權令關平辭訟事。",
      "person_id": "ks4_7z0_n17",
      "related_person_ids": [
        "xuu_do0_zbf",
        "syc_ik6_bq5_**AAA",
        "572_278_cba"
      ],
      "reading": "第二個吳書引文記祺與張溫顧譚友善，數位提前置於奮之後，殿本繫祺名下。"
    }
  ],
